WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:30.370 --> 00:01:35.020
Dartz activated a second Seal: Orichalcos Deuteros.

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:42.260
It restores his life points every turn, and we can't attack him directly.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:47.170
And the Mirror Knights he summoned to his field...

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:52.970
They're the captured souls of my partner, Jonouchi and the others!

00:01:52.970 --> 00:01:54.970
That's dirty, Dartz!

00:01:54.970 --> 00:02:00.970
Captured Mirror Knights

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:32.550
Partner...

00:02:32.550 --> 00:02:34.870
Dartz!  What is this!

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:40.820
I control the captured souls, Nameless Pharaoh and Seto.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:45.660
I transfered your friends’ souls into the Mirror Knights.

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:48.760
They're pawns under my control.

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.400
Yugi!

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:51.690
That’s not fair, Dartz!

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:54.950
I'm showing compassion.

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:56.400
What?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:03:02.560
If I sacrificed their souls, you would've never seen them again.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.780
Dartz, how dare you!

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:11.710
Nameless Pharaoh and Seto, I must make you suffer more.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:19.590
As the darkness in your hearts grow stronger, you'll be worthier sacrifices to my god.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:24.520
Mirror Knight Yugi, attack the Nameless Pharaoh!

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:36.390
You still have the strength to resist me?

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:43.280
Interesting.  Let’s see how long your bond will last!

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:44.840
Dartz!

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:48.320
I set a card.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.010
I end my turn.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:53.670
My turn!

00:03:54.070 --> 00:03:59.950
Since Mirror Knight Calling was destroyed, they can’t restore their invincible shields.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:01.950
Therefore...

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:05.510
I activate the spell card, Pot of Greed!

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.940
I add two cards in my deck to my hand.

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:10.440
Next, I activate Cost Down from my hand!

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:15.800
By discarding a card from my hand, it lowers a monster’s Level by 2!

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:21.170
By using that effect, I can summon Different Dimension Dragon!

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:31.050
Different Dimension Dragon can't be destroyed in battle against monsters with 1900 or less attack points!

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:36.500
And Kaiser Glider can’t be destroyed by monsters with equal attack points!

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:38.800
My battle formation is complete.

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:42.740
Kaiser Glider attacks Mirror Knight Mai!

00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.120
Are you serious, Kaiba?

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:45.970
Big brother...

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:46.860
Kaiba!

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:51.850
Dartz!  If you think this'll trap me, you must be joking!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:55.380
I don’t care if they live or die!

00:04:55.380 --> 00:05:00.020
I just destroy whoever stands in my way!

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:03.050
Don't do it, Kaiba!

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:04.450
Be quiet, Yugi!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:09.510
Don’t you understand this is a trap to stall us?

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:10.900
But...

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:16.240
If we lose, we can't retrieve their souls.

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:18.960
And fail to keep my promise with Dark Magician Girl.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.110
But...

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:23.110
But attack them?

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:26.020
Let me ask you a question.

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.220
What happens if they're destroyed?

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:33.150
Who knows.  I don't care where souls go when they vanish.

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:39.090
If no one knows where they go, then I don't have to worry about it either.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.240
Go, Kaiser Glider!

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.570
Attack Mirror Knight Mai Kujaku!

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:46.570
Golden Burst!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.920
Her mirror shield is gone.

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:55.300
If she gets attacked again, she'll be...

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:58.730
Different Dimension Dragon attacks!

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.640
Don't do it, Kaiba!

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.480
Rainbow Burst!

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:07.850
Mai!

00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:15.620
Jonouchi!

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:16.800
Jonouchi…

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:18.400
…protected Mai!

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.790
How interesting.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:25.180
Jonouchi instinctively protected Mai.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:31.680
Your bonds are actually strengthening my battle formation.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:34.310
That fool got in my way!

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:37.680
I set a card and end my turn.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.120
My turn!

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:43.420
Yugi, Jonouchi and Mai are currently defenseless.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:45.210
Attack them!

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:50.160
I can’t…

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:54.260
Are you willing to lose without doing anything?

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:38.220
They're all irreplaceable friends.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.480
I…

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.990
I end my turn.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.420
Yugi!  How dare you!

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:57.310
It's impossible for the other Yugi to attack them.

00:07:57.310 --> 00:08:00.700
Dartz is so unfair!

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:04.460
My turn.  I draw!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:11.010
Orichalcos Deuteros's effect restores 2500 life points.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.160
Nameless Pharaoh.

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:17.660
If you can’t choose your destiny, I'll choose for you.

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:22.440
I activate the Continuous Spell, Twin Bow Centaur!

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:28.900
Twin Bow Centaur's odds of shooting an arrow are 1 in 2.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.000
The monster that’s hit is removed from play.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.330
And the player takes damage equal to its attack points.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:41.110
The targets are Kaiser Glider and Mirror Knight Jonouchi.

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:42.030
What?

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:47.680
So if the arrow hits him, Jonouchi will vanish?

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:50.170
But if it hits my brother...

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:56.490
Seto and Jonouchi, It's time to determine your fate!

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.420
Destiny chose you, Seto!

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:08.430
Big brother!

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:09.400
Kaiba!

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:18.400
When I activate Twin Bow Centaur’s effect, my monsters can’t attack that turn.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.440
I end my turn.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.010
That chump.

00:09:24.010 --> 00:09:28.410
I'll end your miserable life this time!

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:29.520
Here I go!

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:31.990
Different Dimension Dragon attacks!

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:33.000
Kaiba!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.270
Hey chump!

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:40.130
If you have the pride of a duelist, then be brave and perish!

00:09:41.420 --> 00:09:42.660
Jonouchi!

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:48.060
What?

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.600
Yugi protected Jonouchi this time!

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:56.300
I see.  Your bonds are wonderful.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:10:01.210
You captive souls!  Protect and defend each other!

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:03.880
My turn!

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:08.320
Unless we destroy that Continuous Spell, someone will be shot again.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:12.830
The Quick-Play Spell, Mystical Space Typhoon!

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:16.270
I'll use it to destroy Twin Bow Centaur!

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.400
I end my turn.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.200
My turn.

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:27.020
You destroyed Twin Bow Centaur.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:31.080
But Seto, your life is like a candle before the wind.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.170
Come out, Orichalcos Malevolence!

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:46.420
Due to Orichalcos Deuteros's effect, my life points rise to15500!

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:48.660
15500?

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:52.290
If that monster attacks my brother…

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.110
Too bad, Seto.

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:57.780
It's over for you.

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:05.020
But your sacrifice will lead to a new world.

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.960
Praise Seto.

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:12.250
Orichalcos Malevolence, attack Different Dimension Dragon!

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:21.430
Big brother!

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.320
You’re…

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:53.530
I activate my trap, Attack Guidance Barrier!

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:57.770
It redirects the attack to a different monster in defense position.

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:01.030
And raises its defense points by 600!

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.280
I choose…

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:07.480
Big Shield Gardna!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:15.020
Big Shield Gardna has higher defense points!

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:15.910
All right!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:20.610
But Orichalcos Kyutora absorbs the damage I'd take.

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:25.790
Since it was attacked, Big Shield Gardna switches to attack position.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:30.230
Due to Attack Guidance Barrier's effect, your turn is over.

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:32.890
You're lucky to survive, Seto.

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:35.900
I owe you one.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.060
My turn!

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:41.560
I only have 600 life points.

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:44.510
I have no monsters in my hand that I can summon.

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:48.660
I switch Different Dimension Dragon to defense position!

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:53.320
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:54.840
My turn.

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:58.890
Yugi, summon a monster and attack them!

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:08.260
My other self…

00:13:10.200 --> 00:13:13.600
Don’t worry... about us.

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:18.820
You have... a greater mission...

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:19.840
Partner...

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.280
See, Yugi?

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:31.740
They're prepared to perish.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:32.600
But…

00:13:33.140 --> 00:13:37.470
But Partner, I'm here to save you.

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:40.490
What's wrong, Nameless Pharaoh?

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:44.190
I switch Big Shield Gardna to defense position.

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:47.770
I set a card.

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:50.720
And end my turn.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:52.300
Yugi, how dare you!

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:54.160
Nameless Pharaoh and Seto.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:58.560
You're nothing but mere cogs of destiny.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:14:01.160
Just accept that.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:07.400
Rafael!

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.250
Master Dartz!

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:15.630
Please stop.

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.350
This battle is pointless.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.120
We were wrong.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:25.760
People do have darkness in their hearts.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:32.860
But they have the ability to overcome it!

00:14:32.860 --> 00:14:37.530
Rafael, I never expected you to say that.

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:44.670
Master Dartz, the Nameless Pharaoh freed me from the darkness in my heart.

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.390
Please free them.

00:14:47.390 --> 00:14:51.050
And Valon and Amelda’s souls!

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:57.360
Rafael, do you really think there's no longer darkness in your heart?

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.860
What do you mean?

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:01.840
Hatred, sorrow and despair.

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:05.780
It's true that people can erase the darkness from their hearts.

00:15:06.760 --> 00:15:08.500
Then why?

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.680
Why?

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:14.150
Because that's not how humans truly are.

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:17.080
How humans truly are?

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:22.720
Yes.  The darkness vanishes from their hearts for only a moment.

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:25.820
Look around this chamber!

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:32.200
Many so-called sages struggled to escape the darkness in their hearts.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.740
And did find ways to overcome it.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:44.300
But they could only maintain that status for a moment.

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:51.780
People are too weak and fickle to keep overcoming the darkness in their hearts.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:55.260
You're wrong, Master Dartz!

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:56.560
I…

00:15:56.560 --> 00:16:03.160
Their bond showed me the strength to keep overcoming the darkness!

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:08.200
The darkness in my heart will no longer overtake my soul!

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:10.060
Rafael...

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:11.700
Well said!

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:15.180
That's why Yugi risked his life!

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.400
Master Dartz?

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:26.820
The darkness in your hearts are actually the inequality between people.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:32.460
You must think that all people are equal.

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:34.140
You're saying we're not?

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:39.860
If you're using vague standards, like potential, then you are equal.

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:42.600
But what about reality?

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:46.520
There are haves and have nots.

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:51.300
Those blessed with beauty and talent, and those hated since birth.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:56.580
This world is filled with a darkness called inequality.

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:59.780
And people can't overcome that.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:03.220
That’s the true nature of this world.

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.640
Master Dartz...

00:17:05.640 --> 00:17:09.540
That's why I'm rebuilding this world.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:14.300
Create perfect people who can overcome the darkness in their hearts.

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:16.420
Rafael…

00:17:16.920 --> 00:17:19.580
Valon and Amelda.

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:27.020
You have souls strong enough to accept the darkness in your hearts.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:31.680
And I gave you your destinies.

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:34.700
What do you mean?

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.640
The strong creates destinies.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:47.680
Amelda has darkness in his heart because Kaiba Corporation's weapons killed his brother.

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:49.020
Amelda…

00:17:49.020 --> 00:17:52.000
Is that true, Mokuba?

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:52.960
Yeah.

00:17:52.960 --> 00:17:55.620
That’s why Amelda hated my brother.

00:17:55.620 --> 00:18:03.480
But was it really Gozaburo Kaiba who killed his brother on that battlefield?

00:18:17.060 --> 00:18:21.460
And who burned down Valon’s orphanage?

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:27.700
No way...

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:37.980
Rafael!

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:43.600
Why did your ship sail over an erupting undersea volcano?

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:49.320
Why were you the only one who survived?

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:51.420
Why?  Can it be...?

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:55.000
Brother!

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:56.260
Sonia!

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:57.940
Brother!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:00.860
Sonia!  Julien!

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:08.860
No!  It can’t be true!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:13.160
Your destinies were fixed from the start.

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:16.300
All I did was move it forward.

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:27.500
I needed pawns that would rival the resurrecting legendary dragons and their chosen duelists.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:33.340
Powerful pawns who'd worship me from the bottom of their hearts!

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:36.280
Dartz!  How could you!

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:41.220
My parents...  My brother and sister…

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:49.240
Compared to Doma's mission, they're worthless!

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:59.140
Dartz!  You'll pay!

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:13.260
That’s The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:16.500
But I thought Rafael's Seal was gone!

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:27.000
Don’t do it, Rafael!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:33.870
Once The Seal of Orichalcos activates, it's never gone.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:38.310
This proves the darkness has overtaken your heart again.

00:20:38.720 --> 00:20:41.600
You'll be sacrificed to resurrect my god!

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:02.740
Rafael!

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:04.090
Hey!

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:05.170
Wake up!

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:17.070
Rafael, you just proved that the darkness can never leave the heart.

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:20.390
Dartz!  How dare you!

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:21.840
My turn.

00:21:23.200 --> 00:21:27.520
Now no one will interfere in our duel, Nameless Pharaoh and Seto.

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:31.400
Witness the true power of The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:33.790
And be sacrificed to my god!

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.910
The Seal of Orichalcos...

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:37.950
Its true power?

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:42.310
Yes.  I activate the Orichalcos's third Seal!

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:46.200
Orichalcos Tritos!

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:06.420
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:14.790
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:25.950
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:35.440
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:44.500
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:45.280 --> 00:22:50.010
I'll live feeling them

00:22:50.620 --> 00:22:55.160
For me to be me

00:22:55.160 --> 00:23:03.650
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:04.330 --> 00:23:09.290
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:18.950
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:29.620
Dartz activated the Orichalcos's third Seal: Orichalcos Tritos.

00:23:29.620 --> 00:23:35.120
With the third Seal, The Seal of Orichalcos is now perfect and complete.

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:41.670
Our friends fight us as monsters, and we can't attack him directly!

00:23:41.670 --> 00:23:46.060
Can Yugi and Kaiba escape this hopeless situation?

00:23:46.060 --> 00:23:49.440
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Three Seals of Orichalcos

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:51.020
Duel, standby!
